  "slug": "caprese-on-a-stick",
  "name": "Caprese on a Stick",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "Serve your Caprese salad on toothpicks for a fun, easy appetizer. It takes just a few minutes to thread mozzarella balls, cherry tomatoes, and fresh basil leaves onto the picks and drizzle with olive oil.",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Thread a tomato half, a small piece of basil leaf, and a mozzarella ball onto toothpicks until all ingredients are used. Drizzle the olive oil over the tomato, cheese and basil, leaving the end of the toothpick clean. Sprinkle with salt and pepper. Serve immediately."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 8,
